130	    /** 距末次液位恰满30分钟判定失联派单；不足30分钟不判。尚无数据时以预降开始时刻为基准。 */
131	    private MissContact evaluateMissContact(PumpStation station, PumpdownEvent event,
132	                                            LocalDateTime lastReading,
133	                                            LevelIngestRequest request) {
134	        LocalDateTime baseline = lastReading != null ? lastReading : event.startedAt();
135	        Duration gap = Duration.between(baseline, request.readingTime());
136	        if (gap.compareTo(MISS_CONTACT_AFTER) < 0) {
137	            return MissContact.NONE;
138	        }
139	        // 判定时刻为基准时刻恰满30分钟
140	        LocalDateTime triggeredAt = baseline.plus(MISS_CONTACT_AFTER);
141	        Long orderId = missContactRepository.createIfAbsent(station.code(), event.id(),
142	                baseline, triggeredAt);
143	        return new MissContact(orderId, triggeredAt);
144	    }
145	
146	    private record AutoStop(Long taskId, String reason) {
147	        static final AutoStop NONE = new AutoStop(null, null);
148	    }
